# Premium Video Streaming Platform — Full Frontend Implementation Plan

## Background

Video streaming platform with Django backend (JWT auth + DRF), Go Streamer (Telegram→CDN pipeline), Django Channels WebSocket (AI voice agent), and Mohir.ai STT.

Audit qilingan backend API haqiqiy URL'lari:
- Auth: `POST /v1/auth/login/` → `POST /v1/auth/code/verify/` → register / Google OAuth  
- JWT refresh: `POST /v1/auth/token/refresh/`
- Movies: `GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /v1/movie/` (filterset: title, genre, duration, ordering)
- Movie stream: `GET /v1/movie/{id}/stream/` → 302 → Go Streamer
- Series: `/v1/series/`, Episodes: `/v1/episode/`
- Episode stream: `GET /v1/episode/{id}/stream/`
- Genres: `/v1/genre/`
- Comments: `/v1/movie-comments/`, `/v1/series-comments/`
- Ratings: `/v1/movie-rating/`, `/v1/series-rating/`
- Favorites: `/v1/movie-favourite/`, `/v1/series-favourite/`
- Watch Progress (Movie): `/v1/movie-watchprogress/`
- Watch Progress (Episode): `/v1/series-watchprogress/`
- Semantic search: `/v1/embedding_search/`
- Users (admin): `/v1/users/`
- WebSocket: `ws://host/ws/agent/`
- Swagger: `/` (base URL)

Auth: **JWT** (Bearer token) — `Authorization: Bearer <access>` header orqali. Session-based emas.

---

## Architecture Decision

**Framework:** Next.js 15 (App Router) — SSR/SSG, route protection, TypeScript, file-based routing — bu loyiha uchun optimal.

**Reason:** Vanilla HTML/JS bilan 58-funksiyali voice dispatcher, WebSocket, JWT token refresh, admin panel va protected routes boshqarish juda murakkab va maintenance-nightmare bo'ladi. Next.js bu muammolarni hal qiladi.

**Styling:** Vanilla CSS (CSS Modules + CSS Variables design tokens). TailwindCSS yo'q.

**State:** Zustand (server state: API fetch + manual cache; client state: player, voice overlay, auth)

**Package Manager:** npm

