### Phase 4 — API Client

JWT token:
- `localStorage.getItem('access_token')` → `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
- 401 → auto-refresh via `/v1/auth/token/refresh/` → retry
- Refresh fail → logout → redirect `/login`

Pagination: backend `page_size=5` → frontend pagination component

---

### Phase 5 — Voice Architecture

Documented pipeline preserved exactly:
```
Microphone → MediaRecorder → VAD (silence detection)
→ Mohir.ai STT (direct from frontend, uz language)
→ normalizeUzbekSTT() (5-stage pipeline)
→ tryFastPath() (VIDEO_ACTION_RULES + NON_VIDEO_KEYWORD_PATTERNS)
  → Match? → executeToolWithConfirmation()
  → No match? → AgentSocket.send() → WebSocket → LLM
→ tool_call response → Central Dispatcher
→ PLAYBACK_HANDLERS (DOM) | API_HANDLERS (fetch)
→ TTS (speak result)
→ VoiceOverlay state update (idle/listening/thinking/speaking)
```

